/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687980/extras/8775fc1ed536a8b761b77e96b21c4501.mp4?t=1693960311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>At the moment, the game has:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>130+</strong> Items<br></li><li> <strong>2</strong> Game Modes - Campaign, Sandbox<br></li><li> <strong>7+</strong> Tools<br></li><li> <strong>45+</strong> Missions<br></li><li> <strong>5</strong> Maps / Worlds - Farm, Space, City, Sea, Bunker</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687980/extras/86884fe0380352b51693cc03bec9d8ff.poster.avif?t=1693960311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687980/extras/86884fe0380352b51693cc03bec9d8ff.webm?t=1693960311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687980/extras/86884fe0380352b51693cc03bec9d8ff.mp4?t=1693960311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Players can save their buildings and then publish them to the Steam Workshop.<br>There, players can discuss each other's buildings and rate them.<br><br>You can follow the development of the game and report the found bug on our Discord server.<br>Also there you can discuss the game and chat with other players.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687980/extras/c9f29f23f7b4e76fb3607326ca09761c.poster.avif?t=1693960311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687980/extras/c9f29f23f7b4e76fb3607326ca09761c.webm?t=1693960311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687980/extras/c9f29f23f7b4e76fb3607326ca09761